<!-- No Tomorrow icon set. Hand-authored 24dp vectors (Material-Symbols-style
     geometry). Never traced from SF Symbols. Tinted by NtIcon().

     `person.2`: two solid figures — a small one behind-left, a larger one in
     front-right — each a full head disc over a full half-ellipse shoulder dome
     sitting on one baseline (y 19.28). The back dome is not a half-arc that
     stops mid-air: it runs to its own baseline and is cut only where the front
     dome occludes it, along that dome's outline offset by a 0.32-unit hairline.
     The old pair of open half-arcs read as a clipped glyph at both the 28 dp tab
     size and the 44 dp Bro-card circle. Proportions measured on
     design/ios26-reference/01b-tabbar-crop-2x-smooth.png. -->
